  "summary_en": "Program Director's recruitment and selection policy for Japan's Moonshot Goal 3 call, soliciting integrated, specialized and elemental research toward general-purpose autonomous humanoid AI robots coexisting with humans by 2050. It sets funding limits and selection criteria, and requires ELSI consideration, industry collaboration and security considerations in international collaboration.",
  "key_provisions_or_claims": [
   "Goal: AI robots that autonomously learn, adapt and act alongside humans by 2050; 2030 prototype suitable for private investment.",
   "Three categories: Integrated (up to 3 billion yen/5 years), Specialized (1 billion yen), Elemental (100 million yen/3 years).",
   "Integrated research must address ethical, legal and social issues (ELSI) and societal implementation.",
   "Proposals must present 2050 scenarios and verifiable tasks with conditions and disturbances.",
   "International collaboration must include security considerations; young researchers are emphasized."
  ],
